      "modify_from": "Infer the button's world xy from the calibrated images and its tabletop base, using the wrist view to refine localization.",
      "modify_to": "Identify the same gray circular button-center feature in the current front and wrist images. Using each camera's intrinsics and world-to-camera extrinsics, construct world-space rays through that feature and estimate their closest intersection. Use the resulting point's xy as the button center, cross-checking against the white base. Account for the raised button top; do not intersect its center ray with the tabletop plane. Use this localized button-centered xy for approach, press and retraction."
