  "refused": "No memory changes are needed. The report's episode-specific passage/start examples are not added: the shared passage formula, local geometry calibrations and one-step tolerance determine them. No universal geometric lead model or substitution of full descent duration for activation lead is committed, because the reported evidence supports only local calibrations. The proposed second-passage start of 160 for the geometry requiring a 25-step lead is not committed."
